# Cloudflare Pages redirects. First match wins.
#
# Purpose: carry every URL Google already has indexed on the old site over to
# the new one with a 301, so ranking signals transfer instead of hitting a 404.
# Every target below is a final destination, never another redirect, so no
# request pays for two hops.

# --- Apex to www -----------------------------------------------------------
# The old site canonicalised to www and that is what is indexed, so www stays
# the primary hostname. Without this both hosts serve 200 and split signals.
https://fastexmedia.com/*  https://www.fastexmedia.com/:splat  301

# --- Blog ------------------------------------------------------------------
# The blog now lives at /blog/ as The Architecture Brief, with the four B2B
# posts ported. No redirects needed for those; they keep their slugs.
#
# The retail post was not ported (B2B-only positioning), so it points at the
# closest relevant service.
/blog/social-media-management-for-retails  /services/social-media-marketing/  301
/blog/how-email-marketing-is-not-dead-for-your-d2c-brand  /services/email-marketing/  301
/blog/performancre-makreitng-for-saas-is-lead-enegine  /blog/performance-marketing-for-saas/  301

# --- Renamed and retired pages ---------------------------------------------
# /work became /case-studies. /pricing is gone: engagement shapes now live on
# /services with no prices. /contact is replaced by the single site CTA.
/work        /case-studies/      301
/work/       /case-studies/      301
/pricing     /services/          301
/pricing/    /services/          301
/contact     /strategy-session/  301
/contact/    /strategy-session/  301
/partnership   /strategy-session/  301
/partnership/  /strategy-session/  301

# --- Legacy .html paths from the original static site ----------------------
# Pointed straight at the final destination rather than through the rules
# above, so an indexed .html URL never chains through two redirects.
/index.html    /                   301
/contact.html  /strategy-session/  301
/pricing.html  /services/          301
/services.html /services/          301
/work.html     /case-studies/      301
/about.html    /about/             301
